Title: 200 AMSTERDAM: THE VERTICAL CITY
Credit: Written for the Screen by
Author: Danny Bouldiez
Episode: PART 12: THE CONFESSION & AMPHIBIOUS ESCAPE (CHAPTER 11)

====

INT. SUBTERRANEAN STORM DRAINAGE VAULT - NIGHT

Water is at chest level. 

DEVS ONE, ELENA, JULIAN, ELEANOR, and KLAUS STERLING huddle on an iron service gantry beneath West 69th Street.

Klaus is soaking wet, his Armani suit shredded, shivering uncontrollably.

                         KLAUS
          (weeping in the dark)
          I knew. Aris gave me the seismic modeling two years ago. 
          The foundation was fifty million over budget. If I stopped 
          construction, the lenders would have foreclosed on the whole firm. 
          I chose the building over the earth.

Julian looks at his broken father. He doesn't strike him. He places a steadying hand on his shoulder.

                         JULIAN
          Then help us save the people you put in it.

SOUND: A heavy metal DRAINAGE GRATE above them CREAKS open.

Flashlight beams cut through the steam and mist.

ARIS THORNE leans through the culvert opening.

                         ARIS
          Grab the tow line! One by one!

Devs ties the harness around Eleanor first, then Klaus, then Elena. 

One by one, they dive through the flooded escape tunnel into the rescue craft waiting in the Hudson.

FADE TO BLACK.
